<title>UK: BOE allots 850 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 850 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 850 million stg of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 1.2 billion stg.</p>
<p>It allotted five million stg in bills maturing on or before August 20 and 845 million stg in 6.75 percent repos to August 18 and 20.</p>
</text>
